  "basic_only_policy": {
    "decision": "S9.2 Basic/Extended policy: every resistor and capacitor is a Basic part except the documented electrical exceptions R2/R3 (0.1 % UVLO), R93/R94/R98/R99 (0.1 % guard dividers) and R109 (18 mOhm 1 W metal-alloy shunt, no Basic part exists). ICs, transistors, TVS/Schottky diodes, the inductors and connectors are Extended where JLCPCB has no Basic equivalent. Every machine-assembled part has a C-code with live stock at the dated audit; alternates are recorded in the Alternates field. J2/J3 (box headers) and D8 (panel LED) stay owner-fitted manual parts by the S7/S8 module policy; JLCPCB THT codes are noted for them.",
    "refs": [
      "R2",
      "R3",
      "R93",
      "R94",
      "R98",
      "R99",
      "R109"
    ],
    "why": "Precision UVLO gives the worst-case start < 13 V; precision guard dividers keep the overvoltage margins; the 18 mOhm shunt sets the 2.62-2.95 A CC limit (Kelvin land).",
    "manual_parts": {
      "J2": "Wurth 61201621621 (LCSC C5364137, see s92-sourcing.json); THT option CJT A2541WV-2x8P C5454489 needs a footprint/height check against the IDC plug envelope",
      "J3": "as J2",
      "D8": "3 mm red LED, horizontal panel mount (bent leads, Z 2.0 mm): owner stock; THT option Everlight 204-10SURD/S530-A3-L C99771"
    },
    "cost": "Quantity-1 part prices only; Extended setup fees, attrition, PCB, assembly and shipping are excluded."
